      "message": "I will re-open this comment. If I follow the suggestion, I need to move the location of the enum definition `enum fingerprint_capture_type` to before the definition of this struct. The [struct fp_image_frame_params](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/include/ec_commands.h;l\u003d8452?q\u003dec_commands.h\u0026ss\u003dchromiumos%2Fchromiumos%2Fcodesearch#:~:text\u003d8451-,8452,-8453) defines `fp_capture_type` as `uint8_t`. This later caused wrong values to appear when I ran the `fpinfo` command. I believe we need to define the `enum fingerprint_capture_type` as below for compatibility:\n\n```\nenum fingerprint_capture_type : uint8_t {\n    // ... enum members\n};\n```",
